## Quick Reference

### Key Concepts

| Term | Definition |
|------|------------|
| **Campaign** | A workspace containing guilds, agents, and commissions |
| **Guild** | A team of agents configured to work together |
| **Agent** | An AI entity with specific capabilities and personality |
| **Commission** | A project specification defining work to be done |
| **Artisan** | Medieval term for an agent (used in naming) |

